y; never edit tests.\n\n\nCourse execution contract:\n{\"profile\": \"generic\", \"editable\": [\"cache.py\"], \"required_full_reads\": [\"cache.py\"], \"verify_commands\": [[\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"]], \"required_pages\": [], \"note_topics\": [], \"max_model_calls\": 20}\nUse update_plan before editing, run baseline checks, then read the required files with read_file.\nTools return Python dicts; use their file_hash for expected_hash. Variables persist across actions.\nDo not reset a successful plan or repeat completed baseline checks. Continue the next unfinished action.\nAll writes and tests must use these tools. Call final_answer only after current-file verification.\nos and pathlib are unavailable in action code; use file/command tools. Import allowed modules before using them.\n"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Current plan; retain these exact titles and order, update status only:\n[{\"title\": \"Inspect repository and read cache.py fully\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Run baseline pytest\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"Implement TTLCache in cache.py\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"Run full pytest verification\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"Finalize plan and answer\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Course progress before this request (evidence offered below may satisfy pending items after delivery):\n{\"phase\":\"verify\",\"next_requirement\":\"verify current files: python -m pytest -q\",\"remaining_count\":2,\"requests_left\":8,\"baseline_done\":1,\"changed_files\":[\"cache.py\"],\"verified_current\":0,\"required_checks\":1,\"request_number\":12,\"max_requests\":20,\"requests_after_response\":8}"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Previous action excer